1
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,880
What is Liang Hong doing?

2
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,400
Can't she prioritize?

3
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,080
Such a huge change...

4
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,840
Why wasn't it reported beforehand?

5
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,080
Sir.

6
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:45,120
Staff Officer Liang went with the squad to scout the enemy.

7
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,000
She did report it in advance.

8
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,160
Why didn't she keep a close eye on Guo Zijian?

9
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,840
Guo Zijian is the Red Force's main offensive force.

10
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,160
He is the biggest variable.

11
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,240
He certainly is a variable.

12
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:55,840
With this move of his,

13
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,680
he almost took out the Blue Force Command Post.

14
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,680
Find out immediately

15
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,840
if Guo Zijian carried out

16
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,960
a precision strike on the Blue Force Command Post

17
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:06,520
because he received orders from the Red Force Command Post,

18
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,400
or if he personally

19
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,880
obtained some key information.

20
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,320
Sir, but...

21
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,560
This is a back-to-back exercise.

22
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,240
Whatever tactics they use,

23
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,360
how could they possibly report everything to us?

24
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,680
Don't contradict me.

25
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,520
The hills in this exercise are fixed.

26
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,920
The number of troops is fixed.

27
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,760
Their numbers, their strengths and weaknesses,

28
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,720
I am fully aware of them all.

29
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,880
Right, right, right.

30
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,600
Even if a stone on the battlefield shifted,

31
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,760
you would be fully aware.

32
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,200
Report.

33
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,600
What's the situation with Liang Hong?

34
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,680
Liang Hong's team

35
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,880
followed the 396th Brigade 1st Battalion's recon squad

36
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,880
and discovered the Blue Force Command Post.

37
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,800
Understood.

38
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,680
Hurry up and contact the exercise controller team,

39
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,160
and have them report updates constantly.

40
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:43,720
Yes, Sir.

41
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,640
Did you hear that?

42
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,480
That's the catch here.

43
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,920
Someone like Staff Officer Liang,

44
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,040
who can always grasp the core of any matter,

45
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:59,280
is the best Exercise Controller.

46
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,040
Xu Lingjun.

47
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,880
You really...

48
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:06,000
are getting better at Making snide remarks.

49
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:07,680
Am I?

50
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,400
The results are out.

51
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:26,640
Report.

52
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,160
Speak.

53
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,360
Exercise Control ruled

54
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:30,400
our 1st Battalion's strike on the Blue Force command center was effective,

55
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,520
causing the Blue Force command center

56
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,040
to lose 60% of its combat capability.

57
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,040
Beautiful!

58
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:34,400
Good!

59
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,840
Great!

60
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,080
Wow, nicely done!

61
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,880
60% of their forces damaged...

62
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,520
That means Long Yuanshan escaped.

63
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:50,240
Our two recon teams might have been captured.

64
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,040
That's a shame.

65
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,600
But right at the start,

66
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,800
Guo Zijian managed to take out

67
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,960
60% of the Black Mamba command headquarters.

68
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,280
That's not bad at all.

69
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,720
Don't celebrate just yet.

70
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,560
Long Yuanshan is an old fox.

71
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,240
A crazy old fox.

72
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,200
Taking a bite out of him won't be easy.

73
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,560
Regardless,

74
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,600
in Long Yuanshan's history of exercises,

75
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,280
this must be a first.

76
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,520
Political Commissar, where are you going?

77
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,840
I've been holding it in. To the restroom.

78
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,920
It was just a fluke.

79
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:25,120
Faults should be punished, merits rewarded.

80
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,520
Long Yuanshan's forces are damaged,

81
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,680
and his position is exposed.

82
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,400
His original battle plan has been ruined.

83
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,320
If my guess is right,

84
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,960
he'll rendezvous with the troops at Jade Emperor Peak

85
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,120
for a showdown with us.

86
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,400
Are the 3rd and 4th Battalions in position?

87
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,040
They're almost at Shigun River.

88
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,800
Order them

89
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,760
to speed up and secure Jade Emperor Peak.

90
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,200
Yes, sir.

91
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:50,840
Order

92
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,440
the 1st and 2nd Battalions

93
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,960
to stand by and stay on high alert.

94
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,440
Yes, sir.

95
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,160
To shift the strike target this quickly

96
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,120
from West Wind Valley to Second Slope,

97
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,520
they must have prepared a Plan B.

98
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:12,120
It seems the Red Force recon team didn't just stumble in.

99
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,480
They came straight for our command center.

100
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,520
The Red Force must have an expert among them.

101
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,520
When the first recon squad came over,

102
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:23,080
I should've adjusted our combat deployment immediately.

103
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,520
I wasn't vigilant enough.

104
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,200
I was a bit too arrogant.

105
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,800
We underestimated Suo Jian'an.

106
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,080
But since they already knew

107
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,320
the coordinates of our command post,

108
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,280
why did they only send one battalion's firepower

109
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,480
to strike us?

110
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,160
If they had concentrated their main forces here,

111
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,880
we'd very likely have been completely wiped out.

112
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,440
Here's the info the scouts just sent.

113
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,120
Look at the Red Army main force's current deployment.

114
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,680
They're massing at Jade Emperor Peak.

115
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,080
It seems Suo Jian'an wants

116
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,600
to commit to the battle at Jade Emperor Peak

117
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,560
and draw us out into the open.

118
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,200
In that case,

119
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,280
this surprise attack

120
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,960
wasn't ordered by Suo Jian'an.

121
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,520
Furthermore, Suo Jian'an

122
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,640
might not fully trust this person's judgment.

123
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,960
That's why he chose this

124
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,560
strategy he considered safe.

125
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:19,520
Could this just be a battalion commander's spur-of-the-moment idea?

126
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,240
You can tell

127
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,760
it's a main assault battalion,

128
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,800
and its attached firepower is decent.

129
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,560
But its authority is limited, after all.

130
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:30,080
They can't command deeper strike forces.

131
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,480
That's why we managed to escape.

132
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,880
What do you think?

133
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,200
Since they want to draw us to Jade Emperor Peak

134
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,200
for a decisive battle,

135
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,360
then let's grant his wish.

136
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,960
Reinforce Jade Emperor Peak.

137
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,800
Hit them hard.

138
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,880
The more brutal the battle, the better.

139
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,280
In that case, it'll just be a war of attrition.

140
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:06,040
Sometimes attrition creates tactical opportunities.

141
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,440
Since we're launching a Feint attack,

142
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,440
we might as well make it convincing.

143
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,280
Captain, do we engage?

144
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,320
Engage? How can we fight that?

145
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,840
But the Battalion Commander...

146
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,600
Didn't he tell us to clear out enemy remnants?

147
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,840
Can you use your brain for a second?

148
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:36,920
Does that look like remnants?

149
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,720
That's at least the strength of a Combined Arms Battalion.

150
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,920
We aren't scared. Let's take them on.

151
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,200
Take them on? No way.

152
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,680
This battle has just begun.

153
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,480
It's not your time to die a hero yet.

154
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,240
Tell the men to let them pass.

155
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,120
And send two scouts...

156
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,160
...to see where exactly they're going.

157
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,000
Yes, sir.

158
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,080
After all that intense bombing...

159
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,480
...they still aren't crippled.

160
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:09,880
Jade Emperor Peak. Every year, it's Jade Emperor Peak.

161
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:12,480
What kind of game is Long Yuanshan playing here?

162
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,840
Is he really going to fight Red Force at Jade Emperor Peak...

163
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,000
...to the bitter end?

164
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,240
Someone else might fight like that,

165
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,040
...but not Long Yuanshan.

166
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,080
He's a sly old fox.

167
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,720
If he's going to Jade Emperor Peak...

168
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,240
...he must have another motive.

169
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,680
So you're saying...

170
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,240
...Red Force is fighting just to fight,

171
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:34,240
...while Blue Force is fighting to adapt?

172
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,679
Xu Lingjun,

173
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,240
...your understanding has improved.

174
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,039
If it were out of ten points,

175
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:41,919
I'd give you a seven.

176
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,720
I passed again. Thank you, Sir.

177
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,760
What's the status of the maneuver?

178
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,360
Attention!

179
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,440
Sit.

180
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,640
According to your orders,

181
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:52,680
...we flanked directly back from Yellow Stone Ridge.

182
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,200
After Second Slope was suppressed by heavy fire,

183
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,440
...we encountered basically no resistance.

184
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:55,880
However,

185
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,000
we ran into...

186
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,840
...Long Yuanshan's main force while they were relocating.

187
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,840
How many casualties did you take?

188
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,600
None, actually.

189
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,440
I figured that our sharp sword...

190
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,760
...would be put to great use later on.

191
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:05,920
So we avoided close-quarters combat.

192
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,720
However,

193
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,440
I sent two scouts to follow them,

194
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,960
...hoping to locate their backup command post.

195
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,760
Not bad. You've learned to use your brain.

196
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,240
I learned it all from you.

197
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,600
Has Wu Dongsheng returned yet?

198
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,960
He got their core coordinates,

199
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,120
...so they've likely all been taken prisoner.

200
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,280
We'll celebrate their achievement after the battle.

201
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,440
That's great.

202
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,040
What's our next mission?

203
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,720
Stand by and stay on high alert.

204
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,800
Are they treating our main assault battalion like reserves?

205
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,200
I was still planning to go up Jade Emperor Peak...

206
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,920
...and hit these Black Mambas hard.

207
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:39,960
Li Songwei!

208
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:40,680
Here!

209
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,160
The unit I used against the Second Battalion earlier,

210
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:44,320
...a Battalion Combat Group, is assigned to you.

211
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,760
You will move on my orders at any time.

212
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:46,280
Also,

213
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,920
whatever happens with those two scouts,

214
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:48,720
report to me immediately.

215
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,360
Yes, sir.

216
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,840
Why do I have a bad feeling about this?

217
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,680
Are you going to ignore orders...

218
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,840
...and go rogue on your own?

219
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,400
Don't put that label on me.

220
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,160
When have I ever ignored orders?

221
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,960
I'm just adapting to a special situation.

222
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,520
Besides,

223
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,680
I've already reported my actions to the brigade commanders.

224
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,960
Alright, you guys get some rest.

225
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:09,880
Wait for my orders.

226
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,640
Yes, sir.

227
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,680
Long Yuanshan is throwing a combo at us.

228
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,840
Sir, an accident occurred during the exercise.

229
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,400
We need your orders.

230
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:28,280
What kind of accident?

231
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:31,360
Wu Dongsheng, 1st Battalion Recon Squad Leader, 396th Brigade,

232
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,080
while carrying out a reconnaissance mission,

233
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,240
was severely injured in a vehicle accident.

234
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,360
What's his condition?

235
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,800
Right now, our Exercise Controllers

236
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,240
have already taken him to the field hospital.

237
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,920
He is undergoing a comprehensive examination.

238
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:45,240
Initial assessment indicates severe leg trauma,

239
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,000
and he is currently unconscious.

240
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,640
Don't send him to the field hospital.

241
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,440
Pass on my orders.

242
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,600
Dispatch a transport helicopter to send him to

243
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,400
the 189th Hospital, closest to the exercise area.

244
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:55,760
Notify the hospital

245
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,640
to assemble their best experts to stand by for treatment.

246
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,360
Yes, sir.

247
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,600
The ones who arranged for him to go to the field hospital

248
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,520
were Liang Hong's team.

249
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,480
Yes.

250
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,240
Good.

251
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:08,840
She did well.

252
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:11,360
She didn't panic because of the sudden emergency,

253
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,680
nor did she shirk responsibility due to her other tasks.

254
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,760
Of course.

255
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:18,200
Liang Hong is your top student, personally trained by you.

256
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,920
But as for Liang Hong and her team's next tasks,

257
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:21,720
what's the plan?

258
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,880
What do you mean, what's the plan?

259
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,400
She will continue executing her exercise control tasks.

260
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:27,320
Inform her and all other exercise participants

261
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:29,040
that this news must be kept strictly confidential.

262
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:32,120
All issues will be dealt with after the exercise

263
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,080
has concluded.

264
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:33,760
Yes, sir.

265
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:17,440
Reporting, Sir.

266
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,600
What's the situation?

267
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,760
We are facing fierce resistance at Jade Emperor Peak.

268
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,320
Judging from their firepower,

269
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,160
the enemy has far more than just one battalion.

270
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,160
Good.

271
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,600
Just as I expected.

272
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,840
Long Yuanshan came after all.

273
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:32,640
Order

274
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,520
the 2nd Battalion to set out immediately.

275
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,240
With the support of the 3rd and 4th Battalions,

276
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:39,000
launch a full assault on the main peak of Jade Emperor Peak.

277
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,840
Strike directly at the enemy's heart.

278
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,040
Furthermore,

279
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,120
the 1st Battalion will stay on the perimeter of Jade Emperor Peak

280
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,840
to provide support.

281
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:46,720
Yes, Sir!

282
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:49,960
Jian'an,

283
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,080
if we mass all our forces

284
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,400
and assemble them at Jade Emperor Peak,

285
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,080
isn't it too risky?

286
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,760
It's already quite obvious now.

287
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:59,560
Jade Emperor Peak has become a focal point of this Red-Blue confrontation.

288
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,440
We currently have the numerical advantage.

289
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,680
We must seize the opportunity to capture it.

290
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,040
Otherwise, we'll miss the window of opportunity.

291
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,640
But I can't help feeling that this tactic

292
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,240
isn't Long Yuanshan's style.

293
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,480
I actually think

294
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,680
we forced his hand.

295
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,160
He has no other choice.

296
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,440
Let's push a little harder.

297
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,040
Victory is in sight.

298
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,800
This afternoon,

299
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:31,080
the combat troops at Jade Emperor Peak

300
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,560
will carry out two forced assaults.

301
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,800
The time interval between them can be kept

302
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:34,720
to under two hours.

303
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:37,440
This will pin down the Red Army's heavy armor forces

304
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:38,440
and create a siphon effect,

305
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:41,560
luring the Red Army into continuously deploying

306
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,560
follow-up combat forces to Jade Emperor Peak.

307
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,120
Yes, Sir!

308
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,400
The engineer demolition detachment

309
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,240
will wait for the Red Army's heavy armor forces

310
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,640
to reinforce the Shigun River line.

311
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:49,080
On their advance route,

312
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,440
they will conduct indiscriminate demolitions to halt them.

313
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:54,400
Then, laser systems will guide long-range firepower

314
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,040
to conduct precision strikes on the targets.

315
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:56,720
Yes, Sir!

316
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,920
The 4th Heavy Battalion's anti-armor detachment

317
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:01,080
will feign an aggressive push toward the Red Army's command post,

318
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,400
forcing their nearby main forces

319
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:03,920
to launch a full-scale counterattack.

320
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:04,640
Yes, Sir!

321
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,920
The heliborne detachment will seize the chaos for a decapitation strike,

322
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,480
aiming to complete a lightning raid

323
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,960
on the Red Army's command post in the shortest time possible,

324
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,040
and capture Suo Jian'an alive.

325
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:13,600
Yes, Sir!

326
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:14,440
The signal corps,

327
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,880
once the heliborne detachment moves out,

328
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:17,760
will target all communication bands of the Red Army

329
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:19,200
to conduct full-network and full-frequency Jamming,

330
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,000
coordinating with the decapitation strike.

331
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:20,800
Yes, Sir!

332
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:21,840
Move out.

333
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,520
Yes, Sir.

334
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,560
The 1st Battalion is clearly the main assault unit.

335
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,480
Why are we relegated to perimeter support?

336
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,560
Enough, obey orders!

337
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:30,560
Assemble the troops.

338
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:31,640
Yes, Sir.

339
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:32,800
Wait.

340
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,440
Guo Zijian,

341
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,240
in that head of yours,

342
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,360
are you scheming something again?

343
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,360
Something's wrong.

344
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,600
Signalman!

345
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,040
Here, Sir!

346
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:47,240
Connect me to the command post.

347
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:47,720
Yes, Sir!

348
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,240
Reporting, Battalion Commander. You're connected.

349
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:56,520
This is Guo Zijian, 1st Battalion Commander.

350
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,760
You'd better just worry about yourself.

351
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,800
Ridiculous.

352
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,800
You think you're a big shot.

353
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:07,960
Staff Officer Liang,

354
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:08,920
please make sure

355
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,440
you edit this part out for us.

356
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:12,600
This has nothing to do with the exercise.

357
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:14,920
Who were you complaining about?

358
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:18,240
Who else? Guo Zijian.

359
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:20,960
What happened?

360
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,600
He suggested the main forces immediately pull out tonight

361
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,800
from the attack on Jade Emperor Peak.

362
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,280
Can't you change your bad temper?

363
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:40,760
Can't we just talk things out?

364
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,120
Dealing with Liu Xinyan,

365
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:44,680
even a hundred good tempers wouldn't be enough.

366
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,640
But no matter what,

367
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,960
we shouldn't have suggested

368
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,600
that the main force

369
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,400
withdraw from the main battlefield tonight.

370
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:53,360
That's not something a battalion commander should suggest.

371
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,120
Political Instructor.

372
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:58,280
This Long Yuanshan is craftier than a ghost in battle.

373
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:59,960
When have you ever seen him

374
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,600
fight a hard war of attrition head-on?

375
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:04,560
He acted completely out of character at Jade Emperor Peak.

376
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:07,360
And that was after his main force took heavy losses from us,

377
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,360
and he didn't have the numerical advantage.

378
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,040
Let me tell you,

379
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,440
there must be a conspiracy here.

380
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,760
Then what exactly

381
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,240
is his trick?

382
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,040
We can't always rely on intuition

383
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:23,880
to fight battles, can we?

384
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,280
As a commander,

385
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,240
you can't always rely on intuition

386
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,520
to direct a battle.

387
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,560
Alright, I haven't figured it out yet.

388
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:33,000
Then take your time to figure it out.

389
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,800
Before we figure it out,

390
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,600
we just need to do one thing.

391
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,640
Obey orders.

392
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,360
Any news from Li Songwei's scouts?

393
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,040
No.

394
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,880
We have confirmed

395
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,560
that the Red team's command post is at Wild Fox Ridge.

396
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,680
We can execute the decapitation strike at any time.

397
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,000
Brigade Commander.

398
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,040
Caught two tails.

399
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:04,520
Scouts again.

400
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,000
Wave after wave, it's endless.

401
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:09,119
Seems they really won't let go.

402
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,200
Whose soldiers are you two?

403
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,280
Still acting all tough, huh?

404
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:18,920
Interesting.

405
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,440
I'm getting more and more curious.

406
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:22,319
Here's the plan.

407
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,760
The PLA always treats prisoners well.

408
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:25,960
Tell the mess squad

409
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,079
to give these two and those five red-billed birds

410
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,440
an extra dish of fried pork.

411
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,040
Yes, sir.

412
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:30,880
Let's go.

413
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,160
Notify the command post at Tiger's Mouth.

414
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,840
All electronic warfare and jamming equipment,

415
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,600
turn them all on.

416
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,880
Maximize the power.

417
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,160
Yes, sir.

418
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,080
Old Long.

419
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,000
Aren't you afraid of exposing the command post's location?

420
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,600
If he can really find this place based on that,

421
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,600
I'll admit he's capable.

422
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:56,120
Besides, I want to see

423
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,800
the one who stirred up the hornet's nest against me, Long Yuanshan,

424
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,360
and find out exactly who they are.

425
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,600
I think you're

426
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:06,640
thinking of Poaching again.

427
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:15,920
Report.

428
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:16,360
Speak.

429
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:18,000
The Blue team is heavily surrounded by us,

430
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:18,840
and they are attempting to break out.

431
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,480
The command center ordered us to advance quickly

432
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,240
and eliminate them.

433
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:23,920
Break out?

434
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,160
There must be The catch.

435
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,480
Has the brigade command post followed up?

436
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:29,800
No follow-up notification yet.

437
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:32,080
Get me the Second Battalion Commander.

438
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:32,600
Yes, sir.

439
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,520
201, 201.

440
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:37,200
10113, 10113.

441
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:40,760
Report.

442
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:41,240
Speak.

443
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,440
Commander, call from First Battalion Commander Guo Zijian.

444
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,360
Jiang Shengqiang.

445
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,440
I know you have a problem with me,

446
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,800
but now is not the time to butt heads.

447
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,560
I'm not asking you to disobey orders either.

448
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,040
Do you see the Shigun River?

449
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:57,360
The terrain there is narrow,

450
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,920
and heavy equipment passes slowly.

451
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,160
It will take a longer time.

452
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,240
If the enemy strikes us there,

453
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:06,040
our forces will likely be cut off.

454
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:08,920
Do you know why Long Yuanshan is fighting like this?

455
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,840
So I suspect...

456
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:12,160
I know what you're suspecting.

457
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:13,560
Guo Zijian.

458
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:16,480
I know how to fight the Second Battalion's battle.

459
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,200
Mind your own business.

460
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,120
How come you're not angry anymore?

461
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,800
Does getting angry help?

462
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:38,320
How can a commander lose his temper?

463
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,760
I've made my point.

464
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:42,920
How much he understands is up to him.

465
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,800
Since we can't control others,

466
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,320
we just have to rely on ourselves.

467
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,200
We're moving out soon.

468
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:52,080
Where are you going?

469
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:52,960
You go on ahead.

470
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,080
I'm heading to the electronic warfare unit.

471
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,240
Everyone, listen to my orders!

472
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:03,920
Move out!

473
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:04,720
Yes, sir!

474
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:11,000
Order Second Battalion to halt their advance.

475
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,160
Have them reinforce our command center

476
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,840
to prevent a Blue Force decapitation strike.

477
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,400
Deploy heavy equipment decoys

478
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:17,000
near the Shigun River front to confuse the enemy.

479
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:19,160
And keep an anti-aircraft unit in reserve.

480
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:20,840
Isn't this disobeying orders?

481
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:21,800
Cut the crap.

482
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,880
I'll report it to the brigade commander.

483
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,720
Notify Xu Dali.

484
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:29,480
Tell him to guard the northeast side of the brigade command post.

485
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:31,160
He is not to leave without orders.

486
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:31,920
Yes, sir!

487
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,200
This time, Long Yuanshan

488
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,280
seems to...

489
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:47,360
Sir! Sir!

490
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:48,560
Look.

491
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,400
Long Yuanshan has launched his combo attacks.

492
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,720
The show has begun.

493
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:28,960
Report.

494
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:29,840
Speak.

495
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,720
The Shigun River assembly area for heavy armored forces

496
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,240
was hit by the Blue Force's long-range fire.

497
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,080
The losses are severe.

498
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,200
Understood.

499
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:36,080
Yes, sir.

500
00:21:40,040 --> 00:21:41,840
The more Long Yuanshan risks his life like this,

501
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:44,200
the more it proves there's an issue with Jade Emperor Peak.

502
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,520
Chief of Staff.

503
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:46,200
Here.

504
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,040
Quickly organize an evacuation,

505
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:49,600
regroup personnel and equipment,

506
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:52,320
and continue completing the encirclement of Jade Emperor Peak.

507
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,480
This is an order,

508
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:57,480
not a discussion.

509
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:58,920
Yes, sir.

510
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:00,240
Report.

511
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:01,120
Come in.

512
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:06,200
Blue Force vehicles and personnel were spotted in the Shigun River direction.

513
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,200
Using laser guidance,

514
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,560
they are targeting our heavy armored forces

515
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:10,280
by executing pinpoint precision strikes.

516
00:22:10,280 --> 00:22:11,960
Due to destroyed equipment blocking the way,

517
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:13,680
the follow-up forces can't advance further.

518
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,200
What the hell are the security forces doing?

519
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:15,960
Where are they?

520
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:18,080
There are gaps between the battalions responsible for security.

521
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,840
I think the Blue Force used these gaps

522
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:20,760
to infiltrate.

523
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,920
Notify the recon battalion

524
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:22,560
to drive them away.

525
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,280
Yes, sir.

526
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,160
Hurry up!

527
00:22:24,280 --> 00:22:25,040
Yes, sir.

528
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:27,720
Report from the Shigun River direction!

529
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,880
The Exercise Control Center informed us

530
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,760
that after the Blue Force's long-range artillery strike,

531
00:22:30,760 --> 00:22:32,000
their infantry anti-armor forces

532
00:22:32,080 --> 00:22:33,320
have occupied the main passages.

533
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:35,480
At the same time, their engineers

534
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:36,720
blew up and destroyed the various passages.

535
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,640
They have already split our forces.

536
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:40,520
That's so weird.

537
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:42,880
These Blue Force units...

538
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,920
how did they appear in our combat zone so quickly?

539
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:47,200
Where did they pop out from?

540
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:49,400
Order!

541
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:50,240
Yes, sir.

542
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,680
All 1st and 2nd Battalion personnel near the command post,

543
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:53,560
retreat immediately!

544
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:54,080
Yes, sir.

545
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:56,320
Report.

546
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:56,880
Speak.

547
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,520
Since the Blue Force launched their long-range strike,

548
00:22:58,520 --> 00:23:00,280
they started targeting all our communication methods

549
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,680
with full-band Jamming.

550
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,880
We can't communicate.

551
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,040
Change channels and keep trying to contact them

552
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:04,720
until we get through.

553
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:05,400
Yes, sir.

554
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:13,040
What is Long Yuanshan trying to do?

555
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:16,680
The battle has barely just started!

556
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:20,480
He wants a decapitation strike.

557
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:25,400
The support troops don't have heavy equipment.

558
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,320
We must be on guard.

559
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:37,280
The Blue Force's intense Jamming is very formidable.

560
00:23:37,320 --> 00:23:39,080
We're currently conducting anti-jamming against them.

561
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:41,200
Can we use the Jamming signal

562
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:43,040
to determine where the Blue Force command post is?

563
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,440
Theoretically, it's possible.

564
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,440
But we currently don't have the capability

565
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,440
to perform such complex calculations.

566
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:56,640
Don't we have

567
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:59,280
a great Doctor of Information Engineering here?

568
00:23:59,520 --> 00:24:00,960
But she's an Exercise Controller.

569
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:03,000
Wouldn't it be a violation for her to help us?

570
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:04,040
Who asked her to help?

571
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:06,240
I'll just give her a problem to test her.

572
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:07,880
It's a purely professional exchange.

573
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:24,240
I came to see you about a personal matter.

574
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:26,000
Can we turn this thing off first?

575
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:27,360
Battalion Commander Guo,

576
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:29,920
we are currently in an exercise.

577
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:31,320
All right.

578
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:34,480
I just thought

579
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:36,360
that after the exercise is over,

580
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:37,840
I'd treat you to dinner.

581
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:39,120
Just the two of us.

582
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:45,960
What?

583
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:47,120
Are you trying to pursue me?

584
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,920
The book says

585
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,880
inviting a familiar friend of the opposite sex to dinner

586
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:51,960
means you are pursuing them.

587
00:24:52,080 --> 00:24:52,800
I wouldn't dare. I wouldn't dare.

588
00:24:53,320 --> 00:24:55,880
I just want to have a simple academic exchange with you.

589
00:24:57,080 --> 00:24:57,760
That's good.

590
00:24:59,760 --> 00:25:01,160
Do you really look down on me that much?

591
00:25:01,760 --> 00:25:03,280
Anything goes as friends,

592
00:25:03,280 --> 00:25:05,000
but if we were to be partners,

593
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,520
at least in terms of knowledge and IQ,

594
00:25:07,520 --> 00:25:09,320
we need to be on the same level.

595
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:11,600
What does that mean?

596
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:14,920
You, a Doctor, look down on a Master's grad like me?

597
00:25:15,080 --> 00:25:16,520
I didn't say that. You said it yourself.

598
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:19,760
Fine.

599
00:25:20,320 --> 00:25:22,160
But now I think

600
00:25:22,360 --> 00:25:24,360
getting a doctorate isn't that hard.

601
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:27,160
Besides, Deputy Army Commander Liang is your mentor.

602
00:25:27,520 --> 00:25:29,480
It'd be easy for him to pull some strings for you.

603
00:25:34,040 --> 00:25:35,840
My doctorate

604
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:38,440
was earned through my own abilities.

605
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,920
Even though Deputy Army Commander Liang is my mentor,

606
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:42,400
but my doctorate

607
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,360
was earned point by point on my own exams.

608
00:25:44,360 --> 00:25:45,760
It's entirely based on my own abilities,

609
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,160
and has nothing to do with fraud.

610
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,440
Don't get worked up.

611
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,560
How about this?

612
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,280
Recently,

613
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,640
I came across a problem in a book.

614
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:55,600
I've been stuck on it for days.

615
00:25:55,800 --> 00:25:57,520
If you can solve it for me,

616
00:25:57,760 --> 00:25:58,680
I will admit

617
00:25:58,920 --> 00:26:00,000
that your degree

618
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,200
is the real deal.

619
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,880
Ridiculous.

620
00:26:01,960 --> 00:26:03,080
My degree

621
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:04,640
is certified by the academy.

622
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,480
I don't need your approval at all.

623
00:26:08,120 --> 00:26:09,520
If you can't solve it, just say so.

624
00:26:09,520 --> 00:26:10,640
No need for pretty excuses.

625
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:14,280
What problem?

626
00:26:20,840 --> 00:26:21,360
Reporting!

627
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:21,920
Report.

628
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,120
Jiang Shengqiang, Commander of the 2nd Battalion,

629
00:26:23,120 --> 00:26:24,440
is reporting via landline.

630
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:25,320
Deputy Chief of Staff Li

631
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:27,080
has been declared killed in action at the front line.

632
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:29,080
The 2nd Battalion has rallied the 3rd and 4th Battalions.

633
00:26:29,080 --> 00:26:31,080
We're using current forces to block the Blue Army's division tactics,

634
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:33,160
and seeking to counter-encircle them.

635
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:34,240
Good.

636
00:26:35,320 --> 00:26:36,720
Tell Jiang Shengqiang...

637
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,240
tell him I said...

638
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:40,120
he did a beautiful job.

639
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:40,560
Yes, sir!

640
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:41,360
Also,

641
00:26:41,560 --> 00:26:42,320
tell him

642
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:44,160
the Blue Army's command center

643
00:26:44,320 --> 00:26:46,360
has been severely crippled by Guo Zijian.

644
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,920
They've suffered heavy losses

645
00:26:48,040 --> 00:26:49,680
and are already a spent force.

646
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:52,280
Tell him to hit them hard, give them no quarter!

647
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:52,800
Yes, sir!

648
00:26:54,280 --> 00:26:55,520
Good old Jiang Shengqiang.

649
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:57,720
He really stepped up at the critical moment.

650
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:59,360
That's why I say, Political Commissar,

651
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,800
stop fixating on Guo Zijian.

652
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,440
Our brigade is full of talent.

653
00:27:05,080 --> 00:27:05,960
Honestly,

654
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,400
in my eyes,

655
00:27:07,840 --> 00:27:09,200
even two Guo Zijians

656
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:11,920
might not match up to one Jiang Shengqiang.

657
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,640
If Jiang Shengqiang occasionally gets defeated,

658
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:17,440
that's just an anomaly.

659
00:27:18,800 --> 00:27:20,600
You're being biased now.

660
00:27:21,280 --> 00:27:22,760
What Jiang Shengqiang did can also be considered

661
00:27:22,760 --> 00:27:24,560
a last-minute change to the battle plan, right?

662
00:27:24,840 --> 00:27:26,200
They both have merit.

663
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,280
But your attitude towards them

664
00:27:27,320 --> 00:27:28,560
is completely different.

665
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:31,080
I'm not completely dismissing him.

666
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,440
That kid, Guo Zijian,

667
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:35,280
does have some unorthodox talent.

668
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,600
But

669
00:27:37,600 --> 00:27:38,960
he's hard to manage.

670
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:41,440
From my years of experience leading troops,

671
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:43,120
with a personality like his,

672
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:44,360
sooner or later

673
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,480
he'll cause a major disaster.

674
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,200
What's the situation?

675
00:27:52,320 --> 00:27:53,040
The latest battle report.

676
00:27:53,160 --> 00:27:54,800
Long Yuanshan is targeting our commander

677
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:55,640
for a decapitation strike.

678
00:27:55,760 --> 00:27:57,880
Our superiors ordered us to return and reinforce immediately.

679
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:59,280
Staff Officer Hu!

680
00:27:59,400 --> 00:27:59,640
Yes, sir!

681
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,400
Have Li Songwei take a small Battalion Combat Group

682
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:01,920
and come with me.

683
00:28:02,080 --> 00:28:03,400
Everyone else, return to reinforce immediately!

684
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:05,280
The command center is in imminent danger.

685
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,080
If you're not returning to reinforce now, where are you going?

686
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,840
Long Yuanshan has already calculated everything.

687
00:28:08,840 --> 00:28:10,720
No matter how many troops we send now, it's useless.

688
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:11,960
If we want to win this battle,

689
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:14,240
we must launch a decapitation strike before they do.

690
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:22,880
Based on satellite and drone target tracking,

691
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:23,880
locking onto

692
00:28:24,120 --> 00:28:27,280
the Red Army's command center and its security forces.

693
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,000
But note one thing.

694
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:31,480
Leave Suo Jian'an's command center intact for me.

695
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,400
Flying Eagle copies.

696
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:53,160
Where... where are they driving to?

697
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,840
Doesn't this road lead to Tiger's Mouth?

698
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,440
Tiger's Mouth?

699
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:56,920
Yeah.

700
00:28:59,800 --> 00:29:01,120
He lied to me again.

701
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:02,320
Who lied to you?

702
00:29:04,120 --> 00:29:04,800
So?

703
00:29:05,080 --> 00:29:06,560
The expert verified it.

704
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:07,720
Is the answer correct?

705
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,280
I'm impressed.

706
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:10,720
I really am impressed.

707
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:12,440
Tell you what.

708
00:29:13,120 --> 00:29:14,560
I'll submit a report to my superiors.

709
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:17,000
You can come to our battalion as my chief staff officer.

710
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,080
No need.

711
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:20,720
I don't think we're suited to work together.

712
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:22,240
Why aren't we suited?

713
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:24,160
I think we're quite in tune.

714
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:26,760
Besides, the future battlefield...

715
00:29:26,760 --> 00:29:29,000
...will rely more on tools and platforms.

716
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:31,280
It's all linked to information systems.

717
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:33,440
If you don't go to the front lines...

718
00:29:33,560 --> 00:29:34,720
...how can you keep up...

719
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:36,600
...with the rushing tide of army transformation?

720
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,240
No rush.

721
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,800
I have plenty of patience.

722
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:42,840
Dr. Liang.

723
00:29:43,080 --> 00:29:44,360
Think about it carefully.

724
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:49,560
I might end up Helping the bad guy.

725
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:51,920
What are you talking about, Staff Officer Liang?

726
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:52,880
That came out of nowhere.

727
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:05,120
The Blue Army's helicopter fleet took a heavy blow.

728
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:08,400
The Red Army did a great job on this strike.

729
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,280
Yeah, I knew the 396th Brigade...

730
00:30:10,280 --> 00:30:11,760
...would never surrender without a fight.

731
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:13,400
This Jiang Shengqiang...

732
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:15,280
...really doesn't mess around in battle.

733
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:17,000
Not only did he reserve anti-aircraft forces...

734
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:18,680
...he also kept a main force company...

735
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,720
...to prevent a decapitation strike.

736
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:23,680
Long Yuanshan has been invincible all these years.

737
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:24,760
This time...

738
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:26,280
...it's time he suffered a little.

739
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:27,520
Flying Eagle calling Wild Wolf.

740
00:30:27,600 --> 00:30:28,840
Flying Eagle calling Wild Wolf.

741
00:30:29,040 --> 00:30:30,520
Wild Wolf copies. Go ahead.

742
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:33,040
The fleet is under attack by ground anti-aircraft missiles.

743
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:35,520
The fleet is under attack by ground anti-aircraft missiles.

744
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:40,960
The Red Army's anti-aircraft interception...

745
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,160
...was expected.

746
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,000
Initiate plan three.

747
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:46,160
The first formation will approach at ultra-low altitude...

748
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:49,080
...and guide fire to strike their reserve forces.

749
00:30:49,520 --> 00:30:51,360
The second formation will change course...

750
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:53,000
...and flank according to plan three.

751
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,120
Please acknowledge.

752
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,520
Flying Eagle copies.

753
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:16,640
Report! Communications are restored.

754
00:31:17,040 --> 00:31:17,720
Good.

755
00:31:18,080 --> 00:31:19,680
Report! Message from the 2nd Battalion.

756
00:31:20,360 --> 00:31:22,600
They have engaged a Blue Force

757
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:23,600
attack helicopter formation.

758
00:31:23,600 --> 00:31:25,440
Three Blue Force attack helicopters

759
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:26,520
and one transport helicopter were shot down.

760
00:31:26,560 --> 00:31:27,560
The remaining attack helicopters

761
00:31:27,560 --> 00:31:28,760
and transport helicopters fled.

762
00:31:30,120 --> 00:31:31,800
Wasn't Long Yuanshan acting so cocky,

763
00:31:31,800 --> 00:31:33,280
trying to launch a decapitation strike on me?

764
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:35,160
Why did he fly back?

765
00:31:37,560 --> 00:31:39,000
Have we reached the 1st Battalion?

766
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,320
Report!

767
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:41,320
We are connected.

768
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:43,640
Commander Guo ordered the 2nd Armored Infantry Company,

769
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,880
an assault gun platoon,

770
00:31:45,040 --> 00:31:47,040
and some anti-air units back to reinforce the brigade HQ.

771
00:31:47,120 --> 00:31:48,480
He is leading the 1st Infantry Company

772
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,720
and other firepower units

773
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,400
to form a small Battalion Combat Group.

774
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:52,640
They are heading toward Tiger's Mouth.

775
00:31:54,080 --> 00:31:55,040
Tiger's Mouth?

776
00:31:59,040 --> 00:32:00,560
What is he doing at Tiger's Mouth?

777
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:02,520
Why is he disobeying orders?

778
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:03,600
Commander Guo assessed

779
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,360
that Tiger's Mouth

780
00:32:04,360 --> 00:32:06,240
is the current location of the Blue Force HQ.

781
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:07,200
He assessed?

782
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:09,640
What gives him the right to make that assessment?

783
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,960
Why did he make an unauthorized decision?

784
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:24,520
Battalion Commander,

785
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,280
is the Blue Force command post

786
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:27,680
really at Tiger's Mouth?

787
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:30,280
You don't trust my judgment?

788
00:32:31,080 --> 00:32:32,080
It's not that.

789
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,560
The conclusion about Yellow Stone Ridge

790
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:36,040
was based on your data analysis

791
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:38,520
and Wu Dongsheng's on-site intel.

792
00:32:39,360 --> 00:32:40,880
But going for Tiger's Mouth...

793
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:43,400
I feel it's still a bit risky.

794
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:45,280
The problem is

795
00:32:45,280 --> 00:32:47,440
we can't conduct on-site recon right now.

796
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,080
And,

797
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:51,840
I trust Staff Officer Liang's calculations.

798
00:32:57,800 --> 00:32:59,400
To think our main assault battalion

799
00:32:59,800 --> 00:33:01,960
clearly gave this battle such a good start,

800
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:04,040
only to be pushed into a corner like this.

801
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:05,720
It's so frustrating!

802
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:06,560
Never mind.

803
00:33:07,080 --> 00:33:07,800
Let's risk it all.

804
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,880
If we capture the Black Mamba leader alive,

805
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:12,120
let's see who dares to show off in front of us.

806
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:20,320
The battle has reached a point

807
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:22,640
where it's time for Close-quarters combat.

808
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,240
Yeah.

809
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:26,480
No matter how well we fought earlier,

810
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:28,080
if we can't finish strong,

811
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:29,560
it'll all be for nothing.

812
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,880
Looking at the yellow light indicators,

813
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,360
at every key node,

814
00:33:33,360 --> 00:33:34,680
we have our Exercise Controllers

815
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:38,480
to ensure no brilliant showdown is missed.

816
00:33:38,760 --> 00:33:39,560
That's good.

817
00:33:40,360 --> 00:33:42,640
We'll have plenty to say at the final review.

818
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:43,480
Yes, yes.

819
00:33:43,520 --> 00:33:44,200
Right.

820
00:33:48,120 --> 00:33:48,840
Sir.

821
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,160
Look over there.

822
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:52,760
Bring up the feed.

823
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,800
It's time.

824
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,440
Commence operation.

825
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:07,720
Report!

826
00:34:07,840 --> 00:34:08,239
Speak.

827
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,920
We are under long-range fire!

828
00:34:10,080 --> 00:34:11,679
Our defense forces suffered heavy losses.

829
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:13,639
How are they using long-range fire?

830
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,760
Aren't they afraid of hitting their own men?

831
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,159
That was a Blue Force feint.

832
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,760
After pretending to retreat,

833
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:20,199
they lured our forces into

834
00:34:20,199 --> 00:34:21,600
their long-range strike zone.

835
00:34:25,080 --> 00:34:25,880
Report!

836
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,480
What's the situation?

837
00:34:27,600 --> 00:34:28,920
The Blue Force launched a surprise attack.

838
00:34:29,120 --> 00:34:31,239
Command post support units are heavily damaged.

839
00:34:31,679 --> 00:34:33,760
Hasn't the 2nd Battalion entered the defense zone?

840
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:34,960
The 2nd Battalion has indeed engaged the enemy.

841
00:34:35,080 --> 00:34:36,639
But they fell for a Blue Force decoy

842
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,679
and were hit hard by their long-range fire.

843
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:39,800
What about the Reconnaissance Battalion?

844
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:41,560
They mostly have light weapons.

845
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:42,719
They can't hold out for long.

846
00:34:43,080 --> 00:34:44,239
Please, sirs,

847
00:34:44,520 --> 00:34:45,440
evacuate immediately!

848
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:51,880
Political Commissar,

849
00:34:52,120 --> 00:34:53,199
relocate immediately.

850
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:54,400
I'll stay behind.

851
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:55,639
Chief of Staff,

852
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:56,840
protect the Political Commissar.

853
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:58,880
Regroup with Guo Zijian at once.

854
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:00,600
Remember, if anything happens to me,

855
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:02,400
the Political Commissar takes command.

856
00:35:02,520 --> 00:35:02,960
Yes, sir.

857
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,000
Jian'an,

858
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,440
you should evacuate first.

859
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,280
I am the chief military commander.

860
00:35:07,280 --> 00:35:08,360
I ought to stay behind

861
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:09,880
to handle the remaining command duties.

862
00:35:10,720 --> 00:35:11,600
You go first.

863
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:12,720
I'll be as quick as I can.

864
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:31,040
Li Songwei!

865
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:31,880
Here!

866
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,880
Initiate decapitation strike. Capture Long Yuanshan alive.

867
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:34,200
Yes, sir!

868
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:35,880
Teams Two and Seven, move out!

869
00:37:01,200 --> 00:37:02,160
Secure them!

870
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:06,880
We finally meet.

871
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,440
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

872
00:38:15,640 --> 00:38:16,520
Forgive the offense.

873
00:38:16,720 --> 00:38:18,080
Not at all.

874
00:38:19,120 --> 00:38:21,960
Anyway, even if you capture me,

875
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:24,480
it doesn't count as a successful decapitation strike.

876
00:38:25,520 --> 00:38:26,320
What?

877
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:28,880
You handed over command?

878
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:33,360
The exercise control center has live footage.

879
00:38:36,120 --> 00:38:37,760
So what?

880
00:38:37,880 --> 00:38:39,720
You think just because Kang Baoping escaped,

881
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:41,040
your Red force can make a comeback?

882
00:38:41,040 --> 00:38:41,720
Is that it?

883
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:44,200
You know very well

884
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:47,600
your combat losses are heavier than mine.

885
00:38:50,560 --> 00:38:53,760
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo, based on those words alone,

886
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:56,880
you completely deserve to be a prisoner today.

887
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:59,240
You think we're fighting with bayonets?

888
00:38:59,720 --> 00:39:02,320
If this is how you lead troops into battle,

889
00:39:03,160 --> 00:39:05,200
I suggest you go back a few decades.

890
00:39:05,200 --> 00:39:06,560
I don't want to waste my breath on you.

891
00:39:07,720 --> 00:39:08,880
You don't believe me?

892
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:11,120
Let's wait and see.

893
00:39:11,640 --> 00:39:12,640
Wait and see?

894
00:39:15,040 --> 00:39:16,200
What's left to see?

895
00:39:19,560 --> 00:39:21,520
There's nothing left.

896
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:25,160
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo, the battle is over.

897
00:39:25,960 --> 00:39:28,240
The battle is over.

898
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:34,640
It's over.

899
00:39:37,720 --> 00:39:38,760
That's impossible.

900
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,120
Notify the command center.

901
00:39:41,120 --> 00:39:42,720
We're returning to Wild Fox Ridge immediately.

902
00:39:42,720 --> 00:39:43,280
Yes, sir.

903
00:39:43,600 --> 00:39:44,240
There's no need.

904
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:47,720
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo was captured by Long Yuanshan.

905
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,680
The remaining Red forces are extremely scattered,

906
00:39:49,680 --> 00:39:52,040
and the military command center is completely destroyed.

907
00:39:52,240 --> 00:39:53,680
Although Political Commissar Kang Baoping

908
00:39:53,680 --> 00:39:55,280
is currently trying to regroup with you,

909
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:58,080
based on the First Battalion's current command system,

910
00:39:58,520 --> 00:40:00,400
there is no way to establish effective command.

911
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,480
So,

912
00:40:13,040 --> 00:40:15,280
the target assessment on our side

913
00:40:15,440 --> 00:40:16,920
was submitted by you?

914
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:20,840
Yes.

915
00:40:21,080 --> 00:40:22,840
And the order to end the exercise

916
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,840
was also based on your assessment?

917
00:40:25,240 --> 00:40:25,920
Yes.

918
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:26,920
You mean,

919
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:29,200
the answer you gave me at first

920
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,880
was bait?

921
00:40:30,960 --> 00:40:31,640
No.

922
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:33,840
If the answer were bait,

923
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:34,880
that would show bias.

924
00:40:35,120 --> 00:40:36,840
That's not allowed by the exercise rules.

925
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:39,040
In fact,

926
00:40:39,480 --> 00:40:40,720
the answer was correct.

927
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:42,320
It's just that you

928
00:40:42,680 --> 00:40:44,240
Outsmarted oneself.

929
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,280
Just two hours ago,

930
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:47,520
Long Yuanshan was still here.

931
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:49,840
But he used a time gap against you.

932
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:50,800
You

933
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,480
fell into his trap.

934
00:40:53,040 --> 00:40:55,640
But we still have our firepower.

935
00:40:55,640 --> 00:40:56,800
I was just about to tell you.

936
00:40:57,520 --> 00:40:58,640
This area

937
00:40:58,760 --> 00:41:01,160
was just hit by the Blue Force's long-range fire.

938
00:41:01,520 --> 00:41:02,240
Battalion Commander Guo,

939
00:41:03,320 --> 00:41:04,160
you are KIA.

940
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,920
So you're saying,

941
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:14,800
I, Guo Zijian,

942
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:17,280
am now the biggest joke of the entire exercise.

943
00:41:22,160 --> 00:41:23,200
Why aren't you saying anything?

944
00:41:24,040 --> 00:41:25,360
Even if I had something to say,

945
00:41:25,720 --> 00:41:27,600
it should be at the exercise debriefing

946
00:41:27,600 --> 00:41:28,560
as a formal statement.

947
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:30,800
There's no need to explain it to you privately here, is there?

948
00:41:37,720 --> 00:41:38,600
Battalion Commander Guo,

949
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:41,480
a chief staff officer like me...

950
00:41:41,640 --> 00:41:42,600
would you still take me?

951
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:56,760
Battalion Commander.

952
00:41:57,040 --> 00:41:58,440
The Brigade Staff ordered us

953
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,720
to return to camp immediately.

954
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,200
All battalion commanders must attend tonight's

955
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:02,240
expanded Brigade Party Committee meeting.

956
00:42:02,640 --> 00:42:03,640
At 8:00 a.m. tomorrow,

957
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:05,640
the Group Army will hold at the base control hall

958
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,960
an exercise summary and debriefing meeting.

959
00:42:08,080 --> 00:42:10,280
All officers from participating units must attend.

960
00:42:21,640 --> 00:42:22,760
Guo Zijian,

961
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:34,840
tell me,

962
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:37,600
do you think you're so great?

963
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:40,360
That you're invincible?

964
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,320
Why did you act on your own?

965
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:46,400
At the most critical moment,

966
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:47,720
you pulled away the 1st Battalion's main force.

967
00:42:47,720 --> 00:42:49,080
Do you realize that this action

968
00:42:49,080 --> 00:42:51,800
made the entire 396th Brigade a joke?
